                <pb facs="0927" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg825"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">561.311F1/204: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bingham</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-08-30T18:00:00-04:00">August 30, 1933—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>231. For Murphy from Wallace. Congratulations on your great achievement. This is
                    the momentous step.</p>
                <p>You have not yet sent us appendix A or appendix B referred to in text of the
                    general agreement. Please send these to us by cable. If too lengthy to summarize
                    please be sure that full copies are mailed to the Department or bring with you
                    on your return. We are assuming that any further details concerning
                    interpretation of fulfillment of agreement will be taken up through the Advisory
                    Committee. [Wallace.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
